  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2a7f8b01275fa09419b530c467407023, type: 3}
  m_Name: PostExplosionSpeech
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogObject
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 16307adf14f5f81409b8dac9eb0b259e, type: 3}
  dialogue:
  - I know, I know, the seeds (yum, seeds) of friendship were just beginning to sprout
    between us and I've gone and thrown it all away.
  - It's not personal, you know, just following protocol. Policy requires strict
    training criteria for new recruits, and fortunately you've passed with flying
    colors (like brown, white, and green!
  - At least, if you can find a way out of there. I'm sure you'll manage.
  - I'll be waiting for you with a congratulatory plate of bread crumbs, just for
    you! Or for me, if you don't get here in the next... five minutes.
  - Such a shame to see all that equipment go to waste. I hope you had fun working
    with a real piece of history.
  - 'Well, I won''t keep you. You''ll figure something out. Just wing it. '
